# Jeong Jeong's Deserters {1}{W}: "When this creature enters, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature." Any creature will do. On turn 1
# the first Deserters has only itself to target (the only creature there is, so no question is asked) and is a 2/3. Bot2 casts an Ornithopter on turn 2; the second
